build/
# gcov output from `make coverage`.
*.gcov
# The Go C2 renders the build-time config into build/ (see c_agent_builder.go
# and the Makefile's CONFIG_SRC). build/ already ignores it; name the file too
# so a manual CONFIG_SRC that lands elsewhere cannot be committed.
c2_config_embedded.c
# mbedTLS is vendored as source; its compiled libraries/objects are build
# artifacts, not tracked files.
vendor/mbedtls/**/*.o
vendor/mbedtls/**/*.a
bear.config.json
